            <ArticleTitle>Plantar fascial release.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>607-13</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The author reviews the literature for the possible etiology and the conservative and surgical treatment alternatives for mechanically induced plantar heel pain. A long-term retrospective study on a plantar fascial release surgery performed on patients with recalcitrant plantar heel pain, all of whom were unresponsive to conservative therapy, is presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
